#: ../../migration-0.5-to-1.0.md:1 e54778a893f840e1815626548c3305e6
msgid "Migrating async-hyperliquid 0.5 to 1.0"
msgstr "从 async-hyperliquid 0.5 迁移到 1.0"

#: ../../migration-0.5-to-1.0.md:3 d1ebf89551be49a589734b1fbf25b3a4
msgid ""
"Version 1 is a deliberate API break. It removes the dynamic facade and "
"replaces implicit state with two explicit clients:"
msgstr ""
"版本 1 有意引入了不兼容的 API 变更。它移除了动态门面，并用两个显式客户端取代隐式状态："

#: ../../migration-0.5-to-1.0.md:6 3034963433ca41f4894b83556b0850fd
msgid "use `InfoClient` for every credential-free read;"
msgstr "所有无需凭据的读取都使用 `InfoClient`；"

#: ../../migration-0.5-to-1.0.md:7 9f9aa11121d84d69930c822743fe3e3f
msgid ""
"use `AsyncHyperliquid` when signed Exchange actions are required; call "
"root trading workflows when Info resolution is needed and `.exchange` "
"only for Info-independent actions."
msgstr ""
"需要签名的 Exchange 操作时使用 `AsyncHyperliquid`；需要 Info 解析时调用根级交易工作流，"
"仅对不依赖 Info 的操作使用 `.exchange`。"

#: ../../migration-0.5-to-1.0.md:11 b1fd675ac63b41a98878e7b0f9a29ede
msgid ""
"There is no runtime compatibility wrapper. Migrate call sites "
"mechanically and pin existing consumers to `<1` until their migration is "
"reviewed."
msgstr ""
"没有运行时兼容包装器。请按规则逐一迁移调用点，并在迁移通过审查前将现有使用方固定到 `<1`。"

