#: ../../migration-0.5-to-1.0.md:86 d88f2e8d766844c4b5cf20c50383e15b
msgid ""
"`vault_address` is the immutable execution target for the client. It is "
"carried through execution-scoped L1 signing/envelopes and position "
"lookup, and through the protocol-specific subaccount fields used by USD "
"class and asset transfers. Root-scoped administration actions still sign "
"as the main account. Omitting it targets the main account everywhere."
msgstr ""
"`vault_address` 是客户端不可变的执行目标。它会贯穿执行范围内的 L1 签名/信封与仓位查询，"
"也会用于 USD 类别转账和资产转账所使用的协议特定 subaccount 字段。根范围的管理操作仍以 "
"main account 签名。省略它时，所有操作都以 main account 为目标。"

