#: ../../migration-0.5-to-1.0.md:197 7f4f6071c2ee4b3ab03ad09ab92fe3c4
msgid ""
"`place_orders` now owns every batch placement path, including market "
"orders; the provisional RC1 `place_market_orders` helper was removed. A "
"batch may mix outer market and non-market requests, and a perpetual batch"
" may span the base and HIP-3 DEXes. It cannot mix perpetual markets with "
"spot or outcome markets. Builder fees are capped at `100` tenths of a "
"basis point for perpetuals and `1000` for spot/outcome after metadata "
"resolution. Outcome prices use a `0.00001` USDC tick in the "
"`0.00001..0.99999` range. The Exchange, not the SDK, validates minimum "
"order notional."
msgstr ""
"`place_orders` 现在负责所有批量下单路径，包括市价单；临时的 RC1 辅助方法 `place_market_orders` "
"已移除。一个批次可以混合外层市价请求和非市价请求，perpetual 批次也可以跨越基础 DEX 和 HIP-3 "
"DEX。它不能混合 perpetual 市场与 spot 或 outcome 市场。元数据解析后，perpetual 的 Builder "
"费用上限为 `100` 个十分之一基点，spot/outcome 的上限为 `1000`。Outcome 价格在 "
"`0.00001..0.99999` 范围内使用 `0.00001` USDC 的最小变动单位。最小订单名义金额由 Exchange "
"而非 SDK 验证。"

